msgid "Freshtastic Food Hub Toolkit"
msgstr ""

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: nexora-commerce-toolkit.php
msgid "https://example.com/nexora-commerce"
msgstr ""

#. Description of the plugin
#: nexora-commerce-toolkit.php
msgid "Companion plugin for the Freshtastic Food Hub theme: optional built-in store that runs without WooCommerce, market data (units, origin, price history), request for quotation, store pickup and customer-booked courier delivery with time slots, modern order screens and an Order Desk staff role, sales, product and review analytics with a daily report, a customer coupon wallet and points page, package products, a promo pop-up, Facebook and Instagram catalog sync and auto-posting, registration consent records, reCAPTCHA and email login codes, demo content importer and cleanup, wishlist, newsletter provider integrations (Mailchimp, Brevo, Klaviyo), consent-aware analytics events (GA4, GTM, Meta Pixel, Google Ads) and testimonials. Features keep working if you switch themes."
msgstr ""

#. Author of the plugin
#: nexora-commerce-toolkit.php
msgid "Freshtastic Food Hub Team"
msgstr ""

